# Zovus change discipline

## Before editing a function

1. Grep every call site by name.
2. List callers in the response before changing behavior.

## Do not delete “unused” code

The repo has dynamic route handlers, feature flags, and server-provided deck configs. Apparent unused code is often loaded indirectly — leave it unless you prove zero references including dynamic imports and string routes.

## Deck size / pick count

Always take deck size and pick count from **server-provided** parameters / registry. Never hardcode `78` / `36` / `24` as product truth in client session logic.

## Motion

Animations: only `transform` / `opacity`. Honor `prefers-reduced-motion` (Capacitor/WebView battery).

## Timezones

Use IANA timezone strings. Do not encode business rules as UTC offset integers or `getTimezoneOffset()` math.

## Risky features

Ship behind an ENV kill-switch, **default off**.

## Verify

After any change: run `npm run preflight` and fix failures before deploy.
